      "mergeID": "646421338d65b358ce740506",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I tested it with a couple of friends and different avatars via discord screensharing.\n\nSo if you have full body and turn the head left or right while holding the feet still on the ground, they will move together with the head on remote clients and shortly afterward correct themself.\n\nLocally it looks completely fine. With the exception of dynamic bones. For dynamic bones it's local and remote.\n\nThis seems to happen with vive trackers and the kinect as well.",
